-- BEFORE the encoding was opened.  The IDs (A01, B04 ...) are the rows of that file.  No expected value was
-- changed to match the encoding.
--
-- Lines marked "EXPECTED-FAIL" assert MY decided answer and are known to fail against the encoding; each names
-- its class (see INDEPENDENT-FINDINGS.md).  Lines marked "EXPECTED-REFUSAL" assert that the encoding refuses
-- where I flagged the same ambiguity.
