`D` MEANS `the default readings of row IL-29`

GIVEN i IS AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`independent resident` i `under` r MEANS `s 1 "Israeli resident" (a): an Israeli resident in the tax year of` i `under` r

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the presumption arises on` a `,` b `,` c MEANS `a presumption that the centre of life is in Israel arises on` a `days in the tax year,` b `in the tax year before it and` c `in the one before that`

