§ `A21 to A31: counting days from stays (a part of a day is a day)`

GIVEN a IS A DATE
      b IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A stay in Israel`
`stay` a `to` b MEANS `A stay in Israel` WITH `arrived` IS a, `left` IS b

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      sts IS A LIST OF `A stay in Israel`
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for the definition of Israeli resident`
`stays in` y `are` sts MEANS
    `the individual in` y `with` (`counted from the stays` WITH `the stays` IS sts) `, found` NOTHING `, ties` NOTHING `, rebutted:` FALSE `, regulation 2` NOTHING `, regulation 3` NOTHING `, section 14(b)` NOTHING

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      sts IS A LIST OF `A stay in Israel`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`days from stays in` y `of` sts MEANS `the days in Israel in` (`the calendar tax year` y) `, from the stays` sts

