§ `F. Bodies of persons`

GIVEN y      IS A NUMBER
      inc    IS A BOOLEAN
      by     IS A BOOLEAN
      became IS A MAYBE DATE
      elected IS A BOOLEAN
      arrived IS A MAYBE DATE
      cf     IS A BOOLEAN
      asked  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A body of persons in a tax year`
`a foreign-run body in` y `, incorporated:` inc `, run by such an individual:` by `, who became resident on` became `, elected:` elected `, arrived on` arrived `, not resident but for him:` cf `, asked otherwise:` asked MEANS
    `A body of persons in a tax year` WITH
        `the tax year` IS `the calendar tax year` y
        `it was incorporated in Israel` IS inc
        `the control and management of its business were exercised in Israel` IS `throughout the tax year`
        `the control and management in Israel were exercised by an individual who became a first-time resident or a veteran returning resident, or by someone on his behalf` IS by
        `the day that individual became an Israeli resident` IS became
        `that individual elected the adjustment year of section 14(b)` IS elected
        `the day that individual arrived in Israel` IS arrived
        `it would not have been an Israeli resident had the control and management not been exercised in Israel by such an individual or on his behalf` IS cf
        `the body of persons asked otherwise` IS asked

GIVEN b IS A `A body of persons in a tax year`
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`independent body resident` b `under` r MEANS `s 1 "Israeli resident" (b): a body of persons is an Israeli resident in the tax year of` b `under` r

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      inc IS A BOOLEAN
      ctl IS A `How long a connection with Israel lasted in the tax year`
GIVETH A `A body of persons in a tax year`
`a plain body in` y `, incorporated:` inc `, control:` ctl MEANS
    `A body of persons in a tax year` WITH
        `the tax year` IS `the calendar tax year` y
        `it was incorporated in Israel` IS inc
        `the control and management of its business were exercised in Israel` IS ctl
        `the control and management in Israel were exercised by an individual who became a first-time resident or a veteran returning resident, or by someone on his behalf` IS FALSE
        `the day that individual became an Israeli resident` IS NOTHING
        `that individual elected the adjustment year of section 14(b)` IS FALSE
        `the day that individual arrived in Israel` IS NOTHING
        `it would not have been an Israeli resident had the control and management not been exercised in Israel by such an individual or on his behalf` IS FALSE
        `the body of persons asked otherwise` IS FALSE

