§ `J. Vehicle: the monthly value`

GIVEN cl    IS A `The class of a vehicle`
      dr    IS A `The drive of a vehicle`
      reg   IS A DATE
      price IS A NUMBER
      total IS A NUMBER
      days  IS A NUMBER
      itx   IS A NUMBER
      irx   IS A NUMBER
      avg   IS A NUMBER
      jan   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A vehicle put at an employee's disposal`
`a vehicle of class` cl `, drive` dr `, registered` reg `, listed at` price `, daily prices` total `over` days `days, indices` itx `and` irx `, exchange rates` avg `and` jan MEANS
    `A vehicle put at an employee's disposal` WITH
        `a vehicle within the Vehicle Expenses Deduction Regulations of 5755-1995` IS TRUE
        `the class` IS cl
        `the drive` IS dr
        `first registered on` IS reg
        `the original price` IS `by the importer's price list` WITH `the price on the list, with the standard package, the mandatory accessories and the listed additions, with VAT, without promotion prices and discounts` IS price
        `the total of the daily consumer prices in the year of first registration` IS total
        `the number of days they are averaged over` IS days
        `the index known on 1 January of the tax year` IS itx
        `the index known on 1 January of the year of first registration` IS irx
        `the average exchange rate of the import currency in the year of first registration` IS avg
        `the exchange rate known on 1 January of the year of first registration` IS jan

`a car` MEANS `a private or light commercial vehicle of class M1 or N1`

-- a car registered in 2025 whose daily price over 365 days averages "avg", the index rising from 100 to "itx"
GIVEN dr  IS A `The drive of a vehicle`
      price IS A NUMBER
      avg IS A NUMBER
      itx IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A vehicle put at an employee's disposal`
`a 2025 car, drive` dr `, original` price `, average` avg `, index` itx MEANS
    `a vehicle of class` `a car` `, drive` dr `, registered` (YMD 2025 3 10) `, listed at` price `, daily prices` (avg TIMES 365) `over` 365 `days, indices` itx `and` 100 `, exchange rates` 1 `and` 1

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      w IS A NUMBER
      v IS A `A vehicle put at an employee's disposal`
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`monthly in` y `at W` w `of` v `under` r MEANS `s 2(2)(b) — the monthly value of the use of a vehicle in the tax year` y `, fixed by` (`rate facts` w `with indices` 100 `and` 100) `, of` v `under` r

