GIVEN whole IS A NUMBER
      part IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The use of a vehicle in a tax year`
`use of` whole `months and` part `days of a 30-day month` MEANS `The use of a vehicle in a tax year` WITH `whole months it was at the employee's disposal` IS whole, `days of a further part of a month` IS part, `days in that month` IS 30
