§ `L. Mobile telephone (tax year 2025; the ceiling is a note-only figure, but it is at least 80)`

GIVEN workplace IS A BOOLEAN
      expense IS A NUMBER
      paid IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A mobile telephone put at an employee's disposal`
`a phone, workplace only:` workplace `, expense` expense `, employee paid` paid MEANS
    `A mobile telephone put at an employee's disposal` WITH
        `a telephone from which calls can be made to the place of work only` IS workplace
        `the monthly expense` IS expense
        `the part of the monthly expense the employee paid` IS paid

GIVEN p IS A `A mobile telephone put at an employee's disposal`
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`phone value 2025 of` p `under` r MEANS `s 2(2)(b) — the monthly value of the use of a mobile telephone in the tax year` 2025 `, of` p `under` r

